---
// src/components/Testimonials.astro
---

<section id="reviews" class="w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12 lg:px-16 py-28 border-t border-slate-800 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-blue-500/5 rounded-full blur-[100px] pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-16 relative z-10">
    <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-100">
      Trusted by local businesses.
    </h2>
    
    <div class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-slate-900/50 border border-slate-700/50 px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full">
      <span class="flex h-2.5 w-2.5 relative">
        <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-blue-400 opacity-75"></span>
        <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2.5 w-2.5 bg-blue-500"></span>
      </span>
      <p class="text-sm md:text-base font-medium text-slate-300">
        <strong class="text-white">Founding Offer:</strong> The first 10 clients receive a 15% discount in exchange for an honest review!
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 relative z-10">
    <!-- Card 1: BLUE Glow -->
    <div class="bg-slate-800/30 border border-slate-700/50 p-8 rounded-2xl relative transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-blue-500/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(59,130,246,0.15)] group">
      <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-lg mb-4">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
        "The process was completely painless. I run a local shop and don't have time to learn about hosting or code. They handled everything, and the interest-free monthly payments made it an easy decision."
      </p>
      <div>
        <p class="text-slate-100 font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-blue-400 transition-colors">Sarah Jenkins</p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs">Local Retail Owner</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 2: PINK Glow -->
    <div class="bg-slate-800/30 border border-slate-700/50 p-8 rounded-2xl relative transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-pink-500/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(236,72,153,0.15)] group">
      <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-lg mb-4">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
        "Finally, an agency that doesn't charge $5,000 upfront. The website is incredibly fast on mobile, which is where 90% of our customers find us. Communication was strictly through chat, which I loved."
      </p>
      <div>
        <p class="text-slate-100 font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-pink-400 transition-colors">Marcus T.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs">Independent Contractor</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 3: GREEN Glow -->
    <div class="bg-slate-800/30 border border-slate-700/50 p-8 rounded-2xl relative transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-green-500/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(34,197,94,0.15)] group">
      <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-lg mb-4">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
        "We needed our site launched yesterday. I paid the VIP Fast-Track fee, and they delivered a flawless, custom-coded site in record time. Worth every single penny."
      </p>
      <div>
        <p class="text-slate-100 font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-green-400 transition-colors">Elena R.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs">Startup Founder</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Card 4: PURPLE Glow -->
    <div class="bg-slate-800/30 border border-slate-700/50 p-8 rounded-2xl relative transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500/40 hover:shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(168,85,247,0.15)] group">
      <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-lg mb-4">★★★★★</div>
      <p class="text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-8">
        "I was tired of clunky templates holding back my brand. They built a fully custom platform that looks incredible and loads instantly. The ongoing support gives us total peace of mind."
      </p>
      <div>
        <p class="text-slate-100 font-semibold text-base group-hover:text-purple-400 transition-colors">David L.</p>
        <p class="text-slate-500 text-xs">E-Commerce Director</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>